4:T47d,<h2>Making Less Stuff, Better</h2><p>The most sustainable product is the one that doesn't need to be replaced. We focus on quality, repairability, and timeless design so your purchases last for years, not seasons.</p><h2>Sourcing</h2><p>Whenever we can, we work directly with small makers, family-owned mills, and certified sustainable suppliers. We prioritize:</p><ul><li>Organic and recycled materials</li><li>Fair labor practices</li><li>Regional sourcing to reduce shipping footprint</li><li>Transparent supply chains</li></ul><h2>Packaging</h2><p>All our shipping materials are recyclable or compostable. We've eliminated plastic mailers, bubble wrap, and styrofoam. Your order arrives in a kraft box with paper-based protective fill.</p><h2>What We're Still Working On</h2><p>We're not perfect. Some things we're actively improving:</p><ol><li>Carbon-offset shipping by default (we currently offer it as an option)</li><li>Take-back program for worn-out products</li><li>More regional warehouses to shorten shipping distances</li></ol><p>We publish an annual sustainability report — <a href="/contact">reach out</a> if you'd like a copy.</p>0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Pages\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3000/pages\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Sustainability\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3000/pages/sustainability\"}]}"}}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"breadcrumb","data-slot":"breadcrumb","className":"","children":["$","ol",null,{"data-slot":"breadcrumb-list","className":"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-sm wrap-break-word text-muted-foreground","children":[["$","li",null,{"data-slot":"breadcrumb-item","className":"inline-flex 